<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A1316017" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "03" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
HO2S-1 and HO2S-2 On-Vehicle Inspection
</title>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1316017001">
<title>
HO2S Heater
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove engine cover.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect HO2S-1 or HO2S-2 connector with ignition “OFF”.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Using ohmmeter, measure resistance of HO2S connector (sensor side) of sensor heater between terminals “1” and “2” at HO2S connector.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
If faulty condition is found, replace HO2S. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1316018"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
Temperature of sensor affects resistance largely. Check that sensor heater is at correct temperature.
</ptxt>
</attention3>
<spec>
<title>
HO2S heater resistance
</title>
<ptxt>
HO2S-1: 2.5 to 5.0 &#937; at 20 to 30 &#176;C (68 to 86 &#176;F)
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
HO2S-2: 2.5 to 5.0 &#937; at 20 to 30 &#176;C (68 to 86 &#176;F)
</ptxt>
</spec>
